<view class="tool-page"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><van-icon name="arrow-left" /> 应用</view><text class="eyebrow">SAY IT WITH LIGHT</text><text class="title">手持灯牌</text>
  <view class="preview live-preview" style="background:{{form.bg}}"><canvas type="2d" id="livePreview" class="preview-canvas" /></view><text class="hint">{{previewNotice || '实时预览 · 字体、滚动、字号、配色和背景与横屏展示同步'}}</text>
  <van-button type="primary" plain round block loading="{{savingPreview}}" disabled="{{savingPreview}}" bindtap="savePreview">保存预览图片</van-button><text class="hint">保存当前预览画面到相册，滚动文字将截取当前这一帧。</text>
  <view class="card"><text class="label">灯牌文字</text><input value="{{form.text}}" maxlength="40" bindinput="text" placeholder="最多 40 个字"/><view class="row"><text>字体</text><picker range="{{fonts}}" range-key="name" value="{{form.font}}" data-field="font" bindchange="change"><text class="value">{{fonts[form.font].name}} ›</text></picker></view><text class="hint">宋体、楷体取决于手机系统字体，缺少时回退为衬线字体；像素字使用开源免费「缝合像素字体」（SIL OFL 1.1），首次联网加载，不增加安装包体积。</text>
  <view class="row"><text>移动方式</text><picker range="{{directions}}" value="{{form.direction}}" data-field="direction" bindchange="change"><text class="value">{{directions[form.direction]}} ›</text></picker></view><text class="label">字号 {{form.size}}%</text><slider value="{{form.size}}" min="25" max="90" activeColor="#c97982" data-field="size" bindchanging="change" bindchange="change"/><text class="label">滚动速度 {{form.speed}}</text><slider value="{{form.speed}}" min="30" max="240" activeColor="#c97982" data-field="speed" bindchanging="change" bindchange="change" disabled="{{form.direction == 2}}"/>
  <view class="row"><text>柔和发光</text><switch checked="{{form.glow}}" color="#c97982" data-field="glow" bindchange="change"/></view><view class="row"><text>镜像文字</text><switch checked="{{form.mirror}}" color="#c97982" data-field="mirror" bindchange="change"/></view></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="label">预设配色</text><view class="themes"><view wx:for="{{themes}}" wx:key="name" style="background:{{item.bg}};color:{{item.fg}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="theme">{{item.name}}</view></view><view class="row"><text class="label">文字颜色</text><text class="value" data-field="fg" bindtap="openColor">打开取色器 ›</text></view><view class="colors"><view wx:for="{{colors}}" wx:key="*this" class="swatch {{form.fg === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" style="background:{{item}}" data-field="fg" data-color="{{item}}" bindtap="color" /></view><input value="{{form.fg}}" maxlength="7" placeholder="#FFFFFF" data-field="fg" bindinput="change"/><view class="row"><text class="label">背景颜色</text><text class="value" data-field="bg" bindtap="openColor">打开取色器 ›</text></view><view class="colors"><view wx:for="{{colors}}" wx:key="*this" class="swatch {{form.bg === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" style="background:{{item}}" data-field="bg" data-color="{{item}}" bindtap="color" /></view><input value="{{form.bg}}" maxlength="7" placeholder="#000000" data-field="bg" bindinput="change"/></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="label">背景图片</text><van-button plain type="primary" block loading="{{choosingBackground}}" disabled="{{choosingBackground}}" bindtap="chooseBackground">{{form.backgroundImage ? '更换背景图片' : '从相册选择背景图片'}}</van-button><van-button wx:if="{{form.backgroundImage}}" plain block bindtap="clearBackground">恢复纯色背景</van-button><text class="hint">图片仅保存在本机，不上传服务器；横屏时居中铺满，边缘可能裁剪。保存灯牌图片时会包含背景。</text></view>
  <van-popup show="{{showColor}}" round position="bottom" bind:close="closeColor" safe-area-inset-bottom><view class="color-sheet"><text class="label">{{colorField === 'fg' ? '文字' : '背景'}}取色器</text><view class="color-sample" style="background:{{pickedColor}}"></view><text class="color-code">{{pickedColor}}</text><view wx:for="{{['红 R','绿 G','蓝 B']}}" wx:key="*this"><text class="label">{{item}} · {{rgb[index]}}</text><slider min="0" max="255" value="{{rgb[index]}}" data-index="{{index}}" activeColor="{{index === 0 ? '#e96b78' : index === 1 ? '#5daf91' : '#6a92d6'}}" bindchanging="pickChannel" bindchange="pickChannel"/></view><van-button type="primary" block round bindtap="confirmColor">使用这个颜色</van-button><view class="cancel-color" bindtap="closeColor">取消</view></view></van-popup>
  <text class="hint">展示时尝试保持屏幕常亮，不自动提高亮度；退出即关闭常亮。微信胶囊按钮仍由系统保留。</text><van-button type="primary" block round bindtap="start">开始横屏展示</van-button>
  <view class="card multiplayer-card">
    <text class="label">多人灯牌</text>
    <text class="hint">邀请 2～6 人一起同步播放，或把多台手机拼成一条更长的灯牌。</text>
    <van-button plain type="primary" round block bindtap="multiplayer">进入多人灯牌</van-button>
  </view>
</view>
